{"meta":{"id":"null-handling","category":"it/syntax/typescript/types","title":"null 처리 (?. · ??) · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"옵셔널 체이닝 ?. 은 값이 없을 때 undefined, Null 병합 ?? 은 값이 없을 때만 기본값","tags":["typescript","f-null"],"color":"sky","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-sky","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-sky-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-sky-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 border border-sky-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">null 처리 (?. · ??) · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-sky-50/70 border border-sky-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-sky-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 옵셔널 체이닝 ?. 은 값이 없을 때 undefined, Null 병합 ?? 은 값이 없을 때만 기본값</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">옵셔널 체이닝 (?.)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">const user: { name?: string } | null = null;\r\n\r\nconsole.log(user?.name); // undefined  — 값이 없으면 오류 대신 undefined\r\n\r\nconst userName = response?.data?.user?.name;</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>?.</code> 앞의 값이 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>null</code> / <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>undefined</code> 이면 그 자리에서 멈추고 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>undefined</code> 를 돌려준다</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">Null 병합 연산자 (??)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">console.log(userName ?? &quot;이름 없음&quot;); // &quot;이름 없음&quot;\r\n\r\n// || 와 차이: || 는 0, &quot;&quot;, false 도 기본값으로 바꾼다\r\nconst count1 = 0 || 10;  // 10\r\nconst count2 = 0 ?? 10;  // 0   ← null / undefined 일 때만 기본값</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>??</code> 는 값이 <strong>없을 때만</strong> (<code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>null</code> · <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>undefined</code>) 기본값을 지정</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">Non-null 단언 (!) · strictNullChecks</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">function len(s: string | null) {\r\n  // return s.length;     // 오류: s 가 null 일 수 있음 (strictNullChecks)\r\n  if (s === null) return 0;\r\n  return s.length;        // 좁혀진 뒤에는 string\r\n}\r\n\r\nconst el = document.getElementById(&quot;app&quot;)!; // ! : null 이 아니라고 단언 (확실할 때만)</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> 파일 › tsconfig 의 strictNullChecks</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/types/null-handling","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"types","title":"기본 타입","path":"it/syntax/typescript/types"}],"hasImage":false}